sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Flutter App
    participant Guard as JwtGuard / JwtStrategy
    participant US as UserService
    participant Controller as Protected Controller
    participant DB as Database (Postgres)

    Client->>+Guard: Request API + Header (Bearer accessToken)
    Guard->>Guard: Extract & verify JWT signature
    alt Token không hợp lệ hoặc hết hạn
        Guard-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    else Token hợp lệ
        Guard->>+US: getById(payload.sub)
        US->>+DB: Query user by ID
        DB-->>-US: UserRes
        US-->>-Guard: UserRes (req.user = user)
        Guard->>+Controller: canActivate: true
        Controller->>+DB: Xử lý nghiệp vụ & truy vấn
        DB-->>-Controller: Dữ liệu
        Controller-->>-Client: 200 OK (Response Data)
    end
